OL,4,CWoman, 83, dies after being hit by bus 
OL,5,GAn 83-year-old woman has died after    
OL,6,Gshe was hit by a bus in Grimsby.       
OL,8,FHumberside Police said officers were   
OL,9,Fcalled at about 10:20 GMT on Friday to 
OL,10,Freports that a double-decker bus that  
OL,11,Fwas turning right from Broadway onto   
OL,12,FLaceby Road had collided with a        
OL,13,Fpedestrian.                            
OL,15,FThe woman died at the scene and her    
OL,16,Ffamily are being supported by          
OL,17,Fspecially trained officers, police     
OL,18,Fsaid.                                  
OL,20,FThe force asked for witnesses or       
OL,21,Fanyone with dashcam footage to get in  
OL,22,Ftouch.                            G1/4 
