OL,4,CCouncil's SEND improvement plan        
OL,5,Capproved                               
OL,6,GA plan to improve the provision for    
OL,7,Gchildren and young people with special 
OL,8,Geducational needs (SEND) in East       
OL,9,GYorkshire has been approved by the     
OL,10,Ggovernment, the council said.          
OL,12,FEast Riding of Yorkshire Council said  
OL,13,Fits SEND Partnership reform plan would 
OL,14,Fstrengthen local provision and improve 
OL,15,Fearly intervention.                    
OL,17,FLast year, inspectors found            
OL,18,Finconsistencies in the support that    
OL,19,Fchildren in East Yorkshire with SEND   
OL,20,Freceived.                              
OL,22,                                   G2/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
