OL,4,CMural honours airman who fought mid-   
OL,5,Cair fire                               
OL,6,GA mural honouring a World War Two      
OL,7,Gflight engineer who climbed on to a    
OL,8,Gwing to try to put out a fire mid-air  
OL,9,Ghas been painted on the side of a      
OL,10,Gbuilding at a former airfield.         
OL,12,FThe artwork has been painted on the    
OL,13,Fwall of W A South & Sons in Martin     
OL,14,FMoor, Lincolnshire, part of the old    
OL,15,FRAF Metheringham site.                 
OL,17,FIt pays tribute to Flt Sgt Norman      
OL,18,FCyril Jackson, who was awarded the     
OL,19,FVictoria Cross for his bravery after   
OL,20,Fhe attempted to put out a fire while   
OL,21,Ftravelling on a Lancaster bomber that  
OL,22,Fhad been hit by enemy aircraft.   G3/4 
OL,23,D]CNews IndexG102CFlashG150CRegionalG160
